{'symbol': 'D', 'date': '2023-04-03 12:55:00', 'title': 'DOMINION ENERGY UTAH STARTS HYDROGEN BLENDING', 'text': 'NEW HYDROGEN BLENDING PROJECT IN DELTA PROVIDES A WAY TO REDUCE EMISSIONS PLANS INCLUDE UPGRADING TO GREEN HYDROGEN LATER THIS YEAR DEU PREPARES ALL OF ITS DISTRIBUTION SYSTEM TO BLEND HYDROGEN BY 2030. SALT LAKE CITY , APRIL 3, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DOMINION ENERGY UTAH (DEU) LAUNCHED HYDROGEN BLENDING IN DELTA, UTAH AS PART OF AN ONGOING PROJECT TO EXPLORE THE OPPORTUNITIES THIS ZERO-CARBON EMISSIONS FUEL HAS TO OFFER.'}